{"seq":8,"slug":"behavioral-economics","title":"行为经济学","stage":"DONE","category":"economics-finance","chapterCount":4,"docCount":14,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics","rating":{"composite":3.73,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.21,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introMarkdown":"# 行为经济学：非理性决策的科学\n\n## Hub 定位\n\n本 hub 系统讲解行为经济学如何将心理学的实证发现融入经济分析，揭示人们在实际决策中如何受到认知偏误、情绪、社会影响和决策环境的深刻塑造。与同 category 其他 hub 的边界：微观经济学建立理性经济人框架下的供需与均衡模型，本 hub 是对该框架的系统性修正与补充；博弈论研究策略互动中的理性均衡，本 hub 与之互补形成\"行为博弈论\"视角；信息经济学关注信息不对称的激励设计，本 hub 则关注即使信息充分时人们仍会系统性偏离理性预测的规律。\n\n## 学习路径\n\n本 hub 共四章，推荐按顺序学习，认知偏误是后续所有章节的分析基础。\n\n第一章「认知偏误」系统梳理人类决策中最常见的认知偏差——锚定效应、框架效应、可得性启发、过度自信、禀赋效应等。识别这些偏误是行为经济学分析的第一步，也是将理论应用于实践（产品设计、政策制定、个人决策改善）的前提。\n\n第二章「前景理论与决策」深入 Kahneman 和 Tversky 的核心理论贡献：前景理论的价值函数与权重函数、损失厌恶的量化特征、心理账户对消费决策的影响，以及跨期选择中的双曲贴现现象。这是行为经济学区别于传统期望效用理论的理论基石。\n\n第三章「社会偏好」突破纯粹自利假设，研究公平感、互惠动机、利他行为和社会规范如何在市场交易、组织合作和公共品供给中发挥真实作用。人不仅是\"有偏差的理性人\"，还是\"关心他人的社会人\"。\n\n第四章「行为经济学应用」展示理论向实践的转化路径——Thaler 和 Sunstein 的助推框架如何用选择架构改善公共政策效果、行为金融学对市场异象的解释，以及政府\"行为洞察团队\"的实际案例。\n\n## 前置知识\n\n了解微观经济学中的效用理论和供需模型有助于理解行为经济学对传统假设的修正方向。不要求统计学专业水平，但熟悉概率的基本概念会帮助理解前景理论中的权重函数与风险偏好分析。\n\n## 延伸阅读\n\n- [博弈论](../09_game-theory/) — 行为博弈论将认知偏误和社会偏好引入策略互动分析，是本 hub 第三章的自然延伸\n- [微观经济学](../06_microeconomics/) — 行为经济学修正的对象，了解\"标准模型\"有助于理解修正的价值\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cognitive-biases","title":"认知偏误","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics/cognitive-biases","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"anchoring-and-framing","title":"锚定效应与框架效应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics/cognitive-biases/anchoring-and-framing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"availability-and-representativeness","title":"可得性启发与代表性启发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics/cognitive-biases/availability-and-representativeness"},{"seq":3,"slug":"overconfidence-and-confirmation-bias","title":"过度自信与确认偏差","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics/cognitive-biases/overconfidence-and-confirmation-bias"},{"seq":4,"slug":"status-quo-and-endowment-effect","title":"现状偏差与禀赋效应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics/cognitive-biases/status-quo-and-endowment-effect"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"prospect-theory-and-decision","title":"前景理论与决策","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics/prospect-theory-and-decision","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"prospect-theory-foundations","title":"前景理论基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics/prospect-theory-and-decision/prospect-theory-foundations"},{"seq":2,"slug":"loss-aversion-and-risk-attitude","title":"损失厌恶与风险态度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics/prospect-theory-and-decision/loss-aversion-and-risk-attitude"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mental-accounting","title":"心理账户","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics/prospect-theory-and-decision/mental-accounting"},{"seq":4,"slug":"intertemporal-choice","title":"跨期选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics/prospect-theory-and-decision/intertemporal-choice"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"social-preferences","title":"社会偏好","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics/social-preferences","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fairness-and-reciprocity","title":"公平与互惠","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics/social-preferences/fairness-and-reciprocity"},{"seq":2,"slug":"altruism-and-prosocial-behavior","title":"利他与亲社会行为","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics/social-preferences/altruism-and-prosocial-behavior"},{"seq":3,"slug":"social-norms-and-conformity","title":"社会规范与从众","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics/social-preferences/social-norms-and-conformity"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"behavioral-economics-applications","title":"行为经济学应用","doc